# Missing build assets must 404.
#
# The SPA fallback below rewrites everything to index.html with a 200 —
# including requests for /assets/* files that don't (yet) exist. Combined
# with the immutable /assets/* cache rule in _headers, a transient deploy
# propagation gap can get the HTML fallback cached at the edge for a year,
# which crashes every lazy-loaded route (observed in the wild). Static
# assets still win over redirects, so real files under /assets/ are
# unaffected; only genuinely missing ones get the 404.
/assets/*    /index.html   404

/*           /index.html   200
